+"""Experiment 4775: audit .439 ARC nulls for silent no-op bugs.
+
+Spec refs: REQ-ARC-WMTE-4775, SCENARIO-ARC-WMTE-4775-SILENT-BUG-AUDIT,
+SCENARIO-ARC-WMTE-4775-BLOCKED-PRECONDITION.
+"""
